<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:26.310 --> 00:02:27.310
CHAPTER 61

00:02:27.850 --> 00:02:32.290
TOFU-KOZO'S MOLD PANDEMIC

00:02:45.620 --> 00:02:48.980
Hey, Tofu-Kozo, stop staring and help.

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:52.480
I'm a <i>yokai</i> that only carries tofu.

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:55.550
That you are...

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:00.780
It keeps coming down day after day.

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:03.410
We're full into the rainy season.

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:03.300
<i>SOKAI</i> LIVELY APARTMENT

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:08.710
But with all this humidity,
we'll get mold in the apartment.

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:10.730
Oh! There!

00:03:13.690 --> 00:03:15.710
We've got to do something.

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:17.400
Don't worry.

00:03:18.150 --> 00:03:20.510
It may be time to bring him out...

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:31.580
I'm Alkaline Yuriko!

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:33.520
I'm Manganese Ayana!

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.560
I'm Nickel Kana!

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:37.780
Together we are The Batteries!

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:40.320
We'll recharge your heart!

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:41.950
It's a pleasure to be here!

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:46.140
HANDSHAKE EVENT

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:47.970
Th-Thank you...

00:03:48.430 --> 00:03:51.810
You came today, too?! I'm so glad!

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:54.920
Thank you!

00:03:56.570 --> 00:03:57.630
So cute.

00:03:57.630 --> 00:04:00.130
Yuriko's not bad either.

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:02.990
I'm a Yuriko follower.

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:07.200
Kana's standoffish attitude
isn't bad either.

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:15.290
Standoffish attitude...

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:25.320
Hey, Kana, could I copy that homework
that's due soon?

00:04:28.220 --> 00:04:30.080
Ignoring us?

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:36.130
She's got such a standoffish attitude.
Or rather, a gloomy one.

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:37.840
For real.

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:42.840
THE COLLECTED WORKS OF RAINER MARIA RILKE

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:11.870
You surprised me!

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:15.370
You just popped out,
I thought you were a <i>yokai</i> or something.

00:05:22.440 --> 00:05:23.960
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow...

00:05:24.570 --> 00:05:25.650
Huh?!

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:27.840
Oh...

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:34.040
Are you really a <i>yokai</i>?

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:37.730
But a tofu <i>yokai</i> seems more like...

00:05:38.330 --> 00:05:41.730
Tofu!

00:05:42.340 --> 00:05:47.280
I'm not a tofu <i>yokai</i>.
I'm a <i>yokai</i> that only carries tofu.

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:48.450
That's all?

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:49.370
Yup.

00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:51.310
Really?

00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:52.580
Really.

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:53.970
Huh.

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:57.330
Why... do you do that?

00:05:57.690 --> 00:06:01.340
Because I'm just
a <i>yokai</i> that carries tofu.

00:06:03.030 --> 00:06:04.090
Oh.

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:07.510
Are you a human who walks at night?

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:09.050
What is that?

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:11.350
I'm an idol.

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:14.480
I sing and dance before everyone.

00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:15.600
Huh.

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:18.650
Why do you do that?

00:06:18.650 --> 00:06:20.380
Why...?

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:24.860
I was always on the bottom of
the school pyramid.

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:27.010
School pyramid?

00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:35.660
I wanted to prove myself
to the people above.

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:39.140
So I worked hard doing things
to become an idol.

00:06:42.190 --> 00:06:43.550
"Things"?

00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:46.090
My eyesight's actually 20/10...

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:49.530
NICKEL KANA CHARACTER CONCEPT : NONE

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:49.630
but I wear glasses to stand out more.

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:53.030
I actually love liquor...

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:59.270
but my profile says I love strawberries...

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:00.960
And...

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:07.400
I'm actually a germophobe
and I hate touching people,

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:09.760
but I do handshake events.

00:07:10.380 --> 00:07:11.430
But...

00:07:11.760 --> 00:07:15.760
IDOL FESTIVAL
THE BATTERIES : IDOL RANK B

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:15.760
The Batteries are around the middle of
the idol pyramid.

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:20.690
AUTOGRAPHED PHOTO REQUEST RESULTS
1. AYANA   2. YURIKO   3. KANA

00:07:16.850 --> 00:07:20.690
And I'm always at the bottom
of our group pyramid.

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:31.010
I have to make it to the top!

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:35.180
Otherwise, why did I bother
becoming an idol?!

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:37.910
And you're asleep!

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:40.850
I'm a <i>yokai</i> that carries...

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:42.940
You said that already!

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:46.490
I need to try a lot harder.

00:07:46.490 --> 00:07:50.530
It's not like I can just
carry around tofu like you.

00:07:54.180 --> 00:07:56.080
I'm not sure, but...

00:07:56.850 --> 00:08:02.100
that girl seemed... kind of sad.

00:08:04.940 --> 00:08:05.920
Thank you!

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:18.310
Y-You! How did...

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:20.060
Here. Have this.

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:21.060
Huh?

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:23.690
You seemed a little down.

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:25.310
You're talking silly again.

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:28.320
Eat some tofu and feel better.

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:36.820
Hey, <i>yokai</i> or not,
unsolicited gifts are against the rules!

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:39.330
And unwrapped tofu, no less!

00:08:39.930 --> 00:08:42.080
Now get away from her.

00:08:51.610 --> 00:08:52.890
Kitaro!

00:08:52.890 --> 00:08:55.050
Are you okay, Tofu-Kozo?

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:59.730
We always tell you to be careful
when dealing with humans.

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:01.810
I-I'm sorry.

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:05.150
You two shouldn't be so mean.

00:09:05.150 --> 00:09:07.670
S-So cute...

00:09:08.630 --> 00:09:09.920
Gross...

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:14.820
You're pretty weak for a <i>yokai</i>.

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:19.300
I'm just a <i>yokai</i> that carries tofu.

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:27.420
I get it. You're at the bottom of
the <i>yokai</i> pyramid too.

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:29.340
What's "pyramid"?

00:09:29.340 --> 00:09:31.720
It's a status or rank.

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:32.860
Young lady.

00:09:33.610 --> 00:09:37.590
I know human society likes to
divide everything into hierarchies,

00:09:37.950 --> 00:09:41.430
but <i>yokai</i> don't have any status or ranks.

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:44.390
But, don't you want to change?

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:46.100
I'm fine.

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:48.100
So long as I carry tofu.

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:50.670
I...

00:09:52.300 --> 00:09:53.200
Seriously?

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:54.440
Totally!

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:56.070
PLEASE WAIT

00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:02.890
That person I admired long ago...

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:04.980
I want to be like her.

00:10:08.150 --> 00:10:10.890
Don't you have anyone like that?

00:10:10.890 --> 00:10:12.500
Kitaro!

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:14.420
He's strong and cool!

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:17.840
Then don't you ever wish
you could be like...

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:19.300
I don't.

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:20.220
Huh?

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:25.750
I'm sure Kitaro has his purpose
and I have mine.

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:30.820
Do you think... I have such a purpose?

00:10:30.820 --> 00:10:32.400
I'm sure you do.

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:33.800
You think so?

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:37.550
Eat this and feel better.

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:44.250
D-Delicious!

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:48.100
I'll help you find your purpose.

00:10:48.730 --> 00:10:51.710
It's thanks for saying
my tofu is delicious.

00:10:53.980 --> 00:10:55.590
But what will you do?

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:57.930
Be her manager?

00:10:57.930 --> 00:11:00.140
That's a good idea!

00:11:00.140 --> 00:11:02.060
I'd like it if you would.

00:11:02.060 --> 00:11:02.970
What?!

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:04.430
Are you sure?

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:06.350
I'll do my best!

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:09.270
Well, he seems motivated.

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:11.080
I guess so...

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:14.490
Encore!

00:11:14.490 --> 00:11:16.200
Manager, water!

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:17.460
Here you go.

00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:21.010
This is soy milk!

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:24.530
Manager, a handkerchief!

00:11:24.850 --> 00:11:27.120
This is cotton tofu!

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:30.440
Who hears "handkerchief"
and thinks "cotton tofu"?!

00:11:31.730 --> 00:11:33.960
Manager, my makeup tools.

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:35.170
Here you go!

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:37.720
Good, you brought the right stuff.

00:11:37.720 --> 00:11:38.670
My sponge...

00:11:39.030 --> 00:11:41.610
This is freeze-dried tofu!

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:45.180
And it's soaked in broth!

00:11:45.740 --> 00:11:49.000
It's The Batteries! Please check them out!

00:11:49.160 --> 00:11:52.790
LINE END

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:52.790
The line for Nickel Kana is this way!

00:11:53.290 --> 00:11:55.190
Th-Thank you.

00:11:56.090 --> 00:12:00.220
Is everyone ready to cheer?!

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:13.330
<i>SOKAI</i> LIVELY APARTMENT

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:16.250
Oh, Kitaro.

00:12:16.650 --> 00:12:19.220
Is Tofu-Kozo doing well?

00:12:19.220 --> 00:12:20.880
No need to worry.

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:23.030
I sure hope so.

00:12:23.660 --> 00:12:24.740
Kitaro.

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:27.890
The ceiling is so clean.

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:29.640
It's thanks to him.

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:31.020
You...

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:33.020
<i>Ten...</i>

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:35.020
STOCKS CONTINUE FALLING

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:38.530
Aren't there any
profitable schemes out there?

00:12:38.530 --> 00:12:41.240
That's The Batteries member...

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:42.990
Bye, Tofu-chan.

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:44.570
See you tomorrow.

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:50.430
So you're involved with The Batteries?

00:12:51.430 --> 00:12:55.350
Hey, could I get in on a cut of that tofu?

00:12:57.520 --> 00:12:59.670
TOFU-KOZO

00:13:00.690 --> 00:13:04.170
KASA-CHAN

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:04.070
-<i>"Ge."</i>
-<i>"What?"</i>

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:13.250
At our next concert,
we're selling merchandise that we produce.

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:16.020
And they're going to be ranked.

00:13:16.380 --> 00:13:19.360
<i>I-I don't want to be last again.</i>

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:20.590
<i>But...</i>

00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:23.240
T-Tofu-chan.

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:27.080
I heard about the merchandise
from your management.

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:29.180
Wh-What do I do?

00:13:31.600 --> 00:13:32.790
Who are you?

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:35.520
I'm like Tofu-Kozo's big brother.

00:13:36.190 --> 00:13:42.170
Actually, I just had a sure-fire idea
to get the top sales using tofu.

00:13:43.610 --> 00:13:44.720
Using tofu?

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:46.450
Leave it to us!

00:13:47.820 --> 00:13:51.120
MERCHANDISE POPULARITY CONTEST AND CONCERT

00:13:47.820 --> 00:13:51.220
You can only get my T-shirts here!

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:53.970
Would you like a hug pillow of me?

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:57.900
Step right up!

00:13:57.900 --> 00:14:01.360
Nickel Kana's handmade tofu
with molasses and soybean flour!

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:05.490
Plus, as a special bonus,
she'll even feed it to you herself!

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:09.950
<i>I hate this stuff,
but if it's to get out from the bottom...</i>

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:13.410
Directly from Kana-chi?! I should line up!

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:15.830
Hey! Weren't you a Yuriko follower?!

00:14:16.980 --> 00:14:18.600
Hooray!

00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:21.190
Look at that!

00:14:21.980 --> 00:14:24.590
We came to check up on him, but...

00:14:24.820 --> 00:14:26.640
Rat Man again!

00:14:26.640 --> 00:14:30.740
But the fans and Tofu-Kozo seem happy.

00:14:31.490 --> 00:14:33.270
I guess we can go home.

00:14:33.270 --> 00:14:34.970
I'm worried.

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:39.980
Even without any initial cost,
it's this profitable.

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:42.150
Hey, keep it coming!

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:44.570
This is the last batch.

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:45.990
What?!

00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:48.970
I didn't bring any more tofu.

00:14:50.550 --> 00:14:51.950
You've got more here.

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:53.330
This is no good!

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:56.750
This is tofu that's got
<i>yokai</i> mold growing on it.

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:58.080
<i>Yokai</i> mold?

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:00.980
It'll be bad if anyone eats it.

00:15:01.610 --> 00:15:04.010
Tofu-chan, where's the next batch?

00:15:04.010 --> 00:15:06.400
C-Coming right up!

00:15:09.990 --> 00:15:11.810
Yup. It's fine.

00:15:11.810 --> 00:15:13.830
Back to cooking!

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:19.100
Huh? I'm... the top?

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:20.960
MERCHANDISE POPULARITY CONTEST RESULTS
1. KANA   2. AYANA   3. YURIKO

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:21.060
Kana, it's time for the concert!

00:15:21.290 --> 00:15:23.190
We'll go ahead to get ready.

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:24.800
Oh, sure.

00:15:25.840 --> 00:15:28.090
Congratulations, Kana-chi!

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:30.950
Aren't you happy?

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:32.950
S-Sure I am.

00:15:33.180 --> 00:15:35.890
But.. is this right?

00:15:37.060 --> 00:15:38.660
Emergency!

00:15:39.310 --> 00:15:40.910
The concert stadium is...!

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:47.210
Wh-What is this?!

00:15:47.480 --> 00:15:52.760
Rat Man, did you use the tofu
with <i>yokai</i> mold on it?!

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:55.280
W-Well... No, I mean...

00:16:10.050 --> 00:16:11.880
This is my fault...

00:16:14.180 --> 00:16:16.390
Don't touch that mold!

00:16:19.430 --> 00:16:21.830
Are you okay, Tofu-Kozo?

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:23.230
Kitaro!

00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:26.760
Don't blame yourself.
Leave the rest to me.

00:16:26.760 --> 00:16:28.090
I see.

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:32.260
We'll have to remove the mold spores.

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:33.760
I understand.

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:35.680
Spirit Hair Chanchanko!

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:45.980
It's working!

00:16:50.550 --> 00:16:51.670
Oh no!

00:17:08.230 --> 00:17:09.530
Run...

00:17:10.570 --> 00:17:11.840
Hurry!

00:17:12.900 --> 00:17:16.450
Hold on! We'll go get help!

00:17:16.450 --> 00:17:18.470
Kana-chi, let's go!

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:19.850
R-Right!

00:17:40.470 --> 00:17:42.290
What do we do?

00:17:43.180 --> 00:17:44.600
Kana-chi...

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:53.010
I-I'm sorry! This is my fault!

00:17:53.860 --> 00:17:56.180
Don't make that kind of face.

00:17:56.180 --> 00:18:01.660
You're always bringing me happiness.

00:18:03.450 --> 00:18:04.750
Happiness...?

00:18:05.580 --> 00:18:09.270
Because I'm just
a <i>yokai</i> that carries tofu.

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:12.070
Eat this and feel better.

00:18:14.590 --> 00:18:17.550
Tofu-chan, I remember now.

00:18:19.300 --> 00:18:21.490
Why I'm an idol.

00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:25.500
I wanted to bring everyone happiness.

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:26.890
Happiness?

00:18:28.190 --> 00:18:32.690
It wasn't about escaping
from the bottom of some pyramid...

00:18:34.110 --> 00:18:39.660
I wanted to carry the happiness
I was given, and make everyone smile.

00:18:44.410 --> 00:18:49.520
K-Kana-chi! If you do that,
you'll be covered in mold!

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:51.980
I'd rather die than have that happen.

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:54.650
But, not helping everyone is worse!

00:18:54.650 --> 00:18:56.340
<i>Kana-chi...</i>

00:19:07.020 --> 00:19:09.600
Kana-chi, are you okay?

00:19:10.270 --> 00:19:13.000
To make... everyone smile.

00:19:13.650 --> 00:19:15.380
That's why I...

00:19:15.730 --> 00:19:18.720
NEW IDOL UNIT AUDITION

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:24.100
...became an idol!

00:19:43.430 --> 00:19:44.450
Kitaro-san.

00:19:44.930 --> 00:19:46.600
You're awake.

00:19:47.390 --> 00:19:49.330
Tofu-chan, how...?

00:19:49.690 --> 00:19:52.250
It's thanks to Tenjo-Name-san.

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:56.880
Sand Witch told him there was lots of
his favorite food and brought him.

00:19:57.690 --> 00:19:58.670
TENJO-NAME

00:19:58.990 --> 00:20:02.720
Well? How do you like Tenjo-Name's
diluted gastric juices?

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:04.660
G-Gastric juices?!

00:20:05.120 --> 00:20:08.040
Okay! Let's clean this all off!

00:20:12.210 --> 00:20:13.790
Yeah!

00:20:27.470 --> 00:20:28.960
What happened to me?

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:31.960
Kana-chi and the <i>yokai</i> saved us.

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:33.310
Tenjo-Name!

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:35.710
Give us more gastric juices!

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:36.960
Sure thing.

00:20:42.320 --> 00:20:44.550
What?!

00:20:44.550 --> 00:20:47.910
We are in awe of the <i>yokai</i>'s power!

00:20:59.340 --> 00:21:02.570
I've never eaten so much mold before!

00:21:03.260 --> 00:21:05.780
This was your fault again!

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:08.200
C-Cut me some slack!

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:11.460
Thank goodness everyone's okay.

00:21:11.460 --> 00:21:14.140
Tofu-chan, I've made up my mind.

00:21:14.480 --> 00:21:15.420
What about?

00:21:16.150 --> 00:21:20.690
There are people who like me as I am.

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:26.780
It made me realize that there's happiness
that only I can bring.

00:21:27.660 --> 00:21:32.620
I'm going to become
the one-and-only idol who can do that!

00:21:34.750 --> 00:21:37.080
Okay! Good luck!

00:21:44.510 --> 00:21:47.110
Are you carrying again today, Tofu-Kozo?

00:21:47.550 --> 00:21:51.040
It's my purpose to carry tofu!

00:21:53.310 --> 00:21:56.210
<i>"Nickel Kana Tries Her Hand
at Lyric-Writing!"</i>

00:21:56.210 --> 00:21:59.860
<i>"One-and-only idol says she'll carry
the happiness she was given to everyone!"</i>

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:17.750
<i>kimi wa yume boku no yume</i>

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:17.850
<i>You're a dream
My dream</i>

00:22:17.850 --> 00:22:21.320
<i>I'm dreaming in a dream</i>

00:22:17.880 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>yume no naka de yume miteiru</i>

00:22:21.320 --> 00:22:24.820
<i>Let's stay like this forever</i>

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:24.720
<i>itsumade mo kono mama de imashou</i>

00:22:25.130 --> 00:22:28.300
<i>kasuka kimi ga nijimu</i>

00:22:25.130 --> 00:22:28.410
<i>You blur and begin to fade</i>

00:22:28.410 --> 00:22:35.080
<i>Don't you cry
Where did you come from?</i>

00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:35.020
<i>Don't you cry anata wa doko kara kitano?</i>

00:22:35.080 --> 00:22:39.880
<i>A masquerade
Faceless faces laugh</i>

00:22:35.140 --> 00:22:39.770
<i>kamenbutou kao no nai kao ga warau</i>

00:22:39.880 --> 00:22:42.210
<i>Hee-hee-hee</i>

00:22:39.900 --> 00:22:42.150
<i>fufufu</i>

00:22:42.210 --> 00:22:45.920
<i>In dreams, in dreams
Lost in dreams</i>

00:22:42.270 --> 00:22:45.820
<i>yume ni yume ni yume ni samayoi</i>

00:22:45.920 --> 00:22:48.260
<i>Twirling around</i>

00:22:45.940 --> 00:22:48.160
<i>kuru kuru to mawaru</i>

00:22:48.260 --> 00:22:52.560
<i>Everyone dancing, dancing
Looking for love</i>

00:22:48.280 --> 00:22:52.490
<i>dare mo odoru odoru ai wo sagashite</i>

00:22:52.560 --> 00:22:59.330
<i>RONDO, spin, spin
Dream, dream</i>

00:22:52.620 --> 00:22:59.330
<i>RONDO mawareyo maware yume yume</i>

00:23:01.750 --> 00:23:05.110
<i>With unexplained water pollution,
the city is in chaos.</i>

00:23:05.110 --> 00:23:07.440
<i>Dad, is that </i>yokai<i>...?</i>

00:23:07.440 --> 00:23:09.910
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:09.950 --> 00:23:12.950
<i>"The Four Generals of the Underworld
Kurobozu's Trap"</i>

00:23:12.950 --> 00:23:15.350
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
